{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S08、S11、S12停留只有20—25秒，Y的分行叙述和感受提示显得较密，扫屏余裕不如X。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把长叙述拆成容易扫读的短句，并用加亮关键词迅速交代每段的情绪转折和因果关系，观众即使不细读也比较容易抓住故事主线。感受描述不仅更具体，还通过出现时机与音乐进程对应，让情绪变化有了细腻的层次，而不是把一堆情绪标签同时摆出来。它的主要代价是少数短时段信息偏密，个别地方对人物动机的解释也比X更进一步。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "72b8eb1e-e90f-4b86-aa3c-32dd6e07fc91", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T194516809247Z", "elapsed_seconds": 82.312, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:46:39.135463+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2f85a643fb68d819528f85c4d86e01cfd7b37bc6f000102d69800ee94c1dbfe9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025